---
description: Code comments must be written in English only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Code comments: English only

- Write **all code comments in English**: `//`, `/* */`, JSDoc, PHPDoc, `#` comments, docblocks, TODO/FIXME notes.
- This applies to every language in the repo (TypeScript/TSX, PHP, SQL, YAML, shell, etc.).
- User-facing strings (UI text, validation messages, emails, API error messages) stay in **Russian** — this rule is about comments only.
- When editing a file that already contains Russian comments, translate only the comments you touch; do not mass-rewrite unrelated ones.
